h0]]。$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 是理论类，不是自然数集合的可判定类；参数 $L,g,\\mathcal P$ 在各次调用中保持不变。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arith0","status":"resolved","id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为固定的有效可数语言，$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。固定 [[57-df-provable]] 的证明系统 $\\mathcal P$，本文件 $T\\vdash\\varphi$ 指 $T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi$。$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的集合重载见 [[57-df-arith0]]。$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 是理论类，不是自然数集合的可判定类；参数 $L,g,\\mathcal P$ 在各次调用中保持不变。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"L,g,\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ThmCode}(T)\\coloneqq\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land T\\vdash\\varphi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Dec}\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ThmCode}(T)\\in\\mathrm{Rec},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Dec}(T)\\leftrightarrow T\\in\\mathrm{Dec},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Undec}(T)\\leftrightarrow T\\notin\\mathrm{Dec}.","display":true}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $p=0$ 或 $p$ 为素数。$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}$、$\\mathrm{Field}$、$\\mathrm{Char}$ 见 [[57-df-field]]，$\\mathrm{ACF}$ 见 [[57-df-acf]]。保留原逆元函数在零处未指定值的约定。$g$ 为该有限语言的有效编码；$\\vdash$ 为标准 Hilbert 推导，$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 取 [[57-df-decidable-theory]]。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}$；$\\mathrm{EffQE}$ 在下式定义，$\\mathrm{Rec}(q)$ 是函数递归性，$q$ 是总函数。"},{"id":"d8ad50b1bb4a4cb1","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是有效的有限纯关系语言：无常量、正元函数及零元关系符号；允许逻辑等号。$g$ 是 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的有效语法编码，$\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 取 [[57-df-prenex]]，$\\mathrm{QF}_S$ 取 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\sigma\\})$ 是该单句的可满足性。$\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}$ 是数集可判定类，不是 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的理论类 Dec；其与 $\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的关系在下式明示。"},{"id":"96557e0d89e19386","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 为满足 $\\mathrm{DLO}\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 的固定 $S_<$-结构。本文件无参数的 $\\mathrm{DLO}$ 保留原理论对象写法，定义为 $\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{DLO}})$；不与结构谓词 $\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)$ 混淆。$g$ 为 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的有效编码，$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 取标准 Hilbert 演算下的 [[57-df-decidable-theory]]。"},{"id":"5481861a76f8e7d4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 为 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 在同一语言、编码和标准演算下的理论类。$T'$ 也限于 $S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$-句子集；此定理不要求 $T'$ 自身有效公理化。"},{"id":"1fec9e09caafbb6c","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 为 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 在同一语言、编码和标准演算下的理论类。$T'$ 也限于 $S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$-句子集；此定理不要求 $T'$ 自身有效公理化。"},{"id":"0df613e30f0e3f59","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b0fcfc053ad38255","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"536f78c4d1ada7bd","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。本文件 $\\mathrm{Dec}$ 使用 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的理论类，演算固定为标准 Hilbert 演算。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 是数值集合类。$\\Sigma_1^0$ 仅在下式第二行表示 [[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]] 的语法公式集合，$E_1$ 为其标准真句子的码集。"},{"id":"14f0accd0b75a0b1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_1,S_2$ 为有效一阶语言，$T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_i}$、$\\mathrm{EffGN}(g_i,S_i)$（$i=1,2$）。两侧证明关系固定为 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的 $\\vdash_H$；$\\mathrm{Undec}(T_i)$ 分别在 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的 $(S_i,g_i,H)$ 环境取值。$\\mathrm{Translation}(e,S_1,S_2)$ 取 [[57-df-translation]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的函数、数集重载取既有定义。$\\mathrm{SynInterp}$ 以下式给出足以转移不可判定性的有效、保守翻译条件；若用四元组 $\\mathcal I$ 记其实现，$e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}$ 必须满足这些条件。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-decidable-theory]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[5